{
  "$comment": "App commands: the native macOS menu (src-tauri/src/menu.rs) and the keyboard shortcuts (src/lib/shortcuts.ts) both read this file. menu: the submenu it goes in; section: items with another section are split by a separator. icon: the Lucide icon the command palette shows (native menus show none). accelerator: Tauri accelerator syntax; on macOS the menu handles it, elsewhere the web view does. keys: a key the web view handles on every platform, never put in the menu (it would stop people typing it). An accelerator without a menu (select-tab-1 to 9) is the web view's on every platform: no menu item takes the key first.",
